    "\n",
    "## 1. 研究背景与数据导入\n",
    "\n",
    "植物在面临营养元素缺乏（如低磷胁迫）时，会主动调节其根系微生物组的装配，以协助自身适应逆境。本报告旨在重现顶级学术期刊中关于拟南芥（*Arabidopsis thaliana*）根系合成菌群（SynCom）在不同磷浓度下的动态变化特征。\n",
    "\n",
    "本步骤将读取实验的 OTU 绝对丰度表与样本 Metadata 信息，并进行基础的数据清洗。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "c6085f00",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "✅ 数据集加载完毕。\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "\n",
    "excel_path = \"data/Supplementary Dataset 2.xlsx\"\n",
    "\n",
    "otu_df = pd.read_excel(excel_path, sheet_name=0, index_col=0)\n",
    "meta_df = pd.read_excel(excel_path, sheet_name=1)\n",
    "tax_df = pd.read_excel(excel_path, sheet_name='taxonomy', index_col=0)\n",
    "\n",
    "otu_df = otu_df.loc[(otu_df.sum(axis=1) > 0), :]\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"✅ 数据集加载完毕。\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "df711938",
